## 5.2 Application Flow

### 5.2.1 Application Startup

```
1. HelloApplication.main() executes
        ↓
2. JavaFX initializes
        ↓
3. DatabaseManager.getInstance() creates tables
        ↓
4. Load LoginView.fxml or hello-view.fxml
        ↓
5. LoginController initialized
        ↓
6. BookStoreFacade created
        ↓
7. All services initialized
        ↓
8. Observer pattern wired (OrderService → InventoryService)
        ↓
9. Login screen displayed
```

**[PLACEHOLDER: Application Startup Screenshot]**

### 5.2.2 Customer Workflow

```
Login → Customer Dashboard → Browse/Search Books → 
Add to Cart → Checkout → Place Order → 
View Order History (Pending → Confirmed → Shipped → Delivered) → 
Leave Review
```

### 5.2.3 Admin Workflow

```
Login → Admin Dashboard → Manage Inventory → 
Confirm Orders → Update Order Status → 
View Statistics → Manage Categories
```

