## 5.3 Feature Implementation Details

### 5.3.1 User Authentication

**LoginController Implementation**:

```java
public class LoginController {
    @FXML private TextField usernameField;
    @FXML private PasswordField passwordField;
    
    private BookStoreFacade facade;
    
    @FXML
    public void initialize() {
        facade = new BookStoreFacade();
    }
    
    @FXML
    private void handleLogin() {
        String username = usernameField.getText();
        String password = passwordField.getText();
        
        if (facade.login(username, password)) {
            User currentUser = facade.getCurrentUser();
            SessionManager.getInstance().setCurrentUser(currentUser);
            
            if (facade.isAdmin()) {
                loadAdminDashboard();
            } else if (facade.isCustomer()) {
                loadCustomerDashboard();
            }
        } else {
            showError("Invalid credentials");
        }
    }
}
```

**Features**:
- Username/password authentication
- Role-based dashboard routing
- Session management via Singleton
- Input validation

