### 5.3.2 Customer Dashboard

**CustomerDashboardController Features** (484 lines):

1. **Book Display with Sorting**:
```java
// Uses Strategy Pattern with HashMap of strategies
private final Map<String, SortStrategy> sortStrategies = new HashMap<>();

@FXML
public void initialize() {
    // Register strategies
    sortStrategies.put("Price (Low to High)", new SortByPrice());
    sortStrategies.put("Price (High to Low)", new SortByPriceHighToLow());
    sortStrategies.put("Popularity", new SortByPopularity());
    sortStrategies.put("Title (A-Z)", new SortByTitleAZ());
    sortStrategies.put("Title (Z-A)", new SortByTitleZA());
}

@FXML
private void handleFilterAction() {
    String selectedSort = sortComboBox.getValue();
    SortStrategy strategy = sortStrategies.get(selectedSort);
    
    List<Book> books = facade.getAllBooks();
    if (strategy != null) {
        strategy.sort(books);
    }
    loadBooks(books);
}
```

2. **Search and Filter**:
```java
@FXML
private void handleSearchAction() {
    String searchText = searchField.getText().trim();
    List<Book> results;
    
    if (searchText.isEmpty()) {
        results = facade.getAllBooks();
    } else {
        // Search by title or author
        results = facade.searchBooksByTitle(searchText);
    }
    
    loadBooks(results);
}

@FXML
private void handleFilterAction() {
    String category = categoryComboBox.getValue();
    if (category != null && !category.equals("All")) {
        List<Book> filtered = facade.filterBooksByCategory(category);
        loadBooks(filtered);
    }
}
```

3. **Add to Cart**:
```java
private void showBookDetails(Book book) {
    // Shows book details with Add to Cart button
    Button addToCartBtn = new Button("Add to Cart");
    addToCartBtn.setOnAction(e -> {
        int quantity = quantitySpinner.getValue();
        facade.addBookToCart(book, quantity);
        updateCartButton();
        showAlert("Success", "Book added to cart!", Alert.AlertType.INFORMATION);
    });
}
```

**UI Components**:
- ListView for books with custom cells showing title, author, price, stock
- Search bar
- Category dropdown filter
- Sort ComboBox (5 strategies)
- Add to Cart buttons
- Cart button with item count badge

