### 5.3.3 Shopping Cart

**CartController Features**:

```java
public class CartController {
    @FXML private ListView<CartItem> cartListView;
    @FXML private Label totalPriceLabel;
    
    private BookStoreFacade facade;
    
    @FXML
    public void initialize() {
        facade = new BookStoreFacade();
        loadCartItems();
    }
    
    private void loadCartItems() {
        Cart cart = facade.getCustomerCart();
        ObservableList<CartItem> items = FXCollections.observableArrayList();
        
        double total = 0.0;
        for (Map.Entry<Integer, Integer> entry : cart.getItems().entrySet()) {
            Book book = facade.getBookById(entry.getKey());
            int quantity = entry.getValue();
            items.add(new CartItem(book, quantity));
            total += book.getPrice() * quantity;
        }
        
        cartListView.setItems(items);
        totalPriceLabel.setText(String.format("$%.2f", total));
    }
    
    @FXML
    private void handleCheckout() {
        facade.placeOrder(); // Creates order, clears cart
        showSuccess("Order placed successfully!");
        navigateToOrderHistory();
    }
}
```

**Features**:
- Display all cart items with book details
- Quantity spinners for each item
- Remove items button
- Real-time total calculation
- Checkout button
- Continue shopping option

