### 5.3.4 Order History

**OrderHistoryController with Multiple Statuses**:

```java
@FXML
public void initialize() {
    facade = new BookStoreFacade();
    loadOrders();
}

private void loadOrders() {
    List<Order> orders = facade.getCustomerOrderHistory();
    
    for (Order order : orders) {
        // Display order with status badge
        String status = order.getStatus();
        String statusColor = getStatusColor(status);
        
        // Status badges:
        // PENDING = Yellow
        // CONFIRMED = Blue
        // SHIPPED = Green
        // DELIVERED = Dark Green
        // CANCELED = Red
    }
}

private String getStatusColor(String status) {
    switch (status) {
        case "Pending": return "#FFC107"; // Yellow
        case "Confirmed": return "#2196F3"; // Blue
        case "Shipped": return "#4CAF50"; // Green
        case "Delivered": return "#1B5E20"; // Dark Green
        case "Canceled": return "#F44336"; // Red
        default: return "#9E9E9E"; // Gray
    }
}

@FXML
private void handleCancelOrder(Order order) {
    if (order.getStatus().equals("Pending")) {
        facade.cancelOrder(order.getId());
        showSuccess("Order canceled");
        loadOrders(); // Refresh
    } else {
        showError("Can only cancel pending orders");
    }
}
```

**Features**:
- List all customer orders
- Color-coded status indicators (5 statuses)
- Order details expansion
- Cancel pending orders only
- View order items
- Track order progression

**Order Status Flow**:
```
Pending → Confirmed → Shipped → Delivered
   ↓
Canceled (only from Pending)
```

