### 5.3.5 Book Reviews

**Review Feature Implementation**:

```java
@FXML
private void handleSubmitReview(Book book) {
    int rating = ratingComboBox.getValue(); // 1-5 stars
    String comment = commentTextArea.getText();
    
    facade.addReview(book.getId(), rating, comment);
    showSuccess("Review submitted!");
    loadBookReviews(book);
}

private void loadBookReviews(Book book) {
    List<Review> reviews = facade.getBookReviews(book.getId());
    double avgRating = facade.getBookAverageRating(book.getId());
    
    averageRatingLabel.setText(String.format("%.1f / 5.0", avgRating));
    
    for (Review review : reviews) {
        // Display review with star rating, comment, user, date
    }
}
```

**Features**:
- Star rating (1-5)
- Text comment
- Average rating display
- Review list with username and date
- Only customers can review

