### 5.3.6 Admin Dashboard

**AdminDashboardController Features**:

1. **Book Management**:
```java
@FXML
private void handleAddBook() {
    String title = titleField.getText();
    String author = authorField.getText();
    double price = Double.parseDouble(priceField.getText());
    int stock = Integer.parseInt(stockField.getText());
    String category = categoryComboBox.getValue();
    String edition = editionField.getText();
    String coverImage = coverImageField.getText();
    
    Book book = new Book(0, title, author, price, stock, category, 0, edition, coverImage);
    facade.addBook(book);
    
    showSuccess("Book added!");
    loadBooks();
}

@FXML
private void handleUpdateBook(Book book) {
    facade.updateBook(book);
    showSuccess("Book updated!");
}

@FXML
private void handleDeleteBook(Book book) {
    facade.deleteBook(book.getId());
    loadBooks();
}
```

2. **Order Management with Status Updates**:
```java
@FXML
private void handleConfirmOrder(Order order) {
    facade.confirmOrder(order); // Triggers Observer pattern!
    // InventoryService automatically reduces stock
    
    // Update status to "Confirmed"
    order.setStatus("Confirmed");
    
    showSuccess("Order confirmed and inventory updated");
    loadOrders();
}

@FXML
private void handleUpdateOrderStatus(Order order, String newStatus) {
    // Admin can update status: Confirmed → Shipped → Delivered
    order.setStatus(newStatus);
    orderDAO.updateOrderStatus(order.getId(), newStatus);
    loadOrders();
}
```

3. **Statistics Display**:
```java
private void loadStatistics() {
    double totalRevenue = facade.getTotalRevenue();
    int totalOrders = facade.getTotalOrders();
    List<Book> topBooks = facade.getTopSellingBooks(5);
    Map<String, Double> salesByCategory = facade.getSalesByCategory();
    Map<String, Integer> ordersByStatus = facade.getOrdersByStatus();
    
    // Display in charts and labels
    revenueLabel.setText(String.format("$%.2f", totalRevenue));
    ordersLabel.setText(String.valueOf(totalOrders));
    
    // Show orders by status breakdown
    displayOrderStatusChart(ordersByStatus);
    // Show category sales
    displayCategorySalesChart(salesByCategory);
}
```

**Features**:
- Book CRUD operations with cover images
- Category management
- Order confirmation (triggers Observer)
- Order status updates (Pending → Confirmed → Shipped → Delivered)
- Sales statistics dashboard
- Low stock alerts
- Top selling books
- Orders by status breakdown

