### 5.3.7 Profile Management

**AccountController**:

```java
@FXML
public void initialize() {
    facade = new BookStoreFacade();
    User currentUser = SessionManager.getInstance().getCurrentUser();
    
    if (currentUser instanceof Customer) {
        loadCustomerProfile((Customer) currentUser);
    }
}

@FXML
private void handleUpdateProfile() {
    String username = usernameField.getText();
    String password = passwordField.getText();
    String address = addressField.getText();
    String phone = phoneField.getText();
    
    boolean success = facade.updateCurrentCustomer(username, password, address, phone);
    
    if (success) {
        showSuccess("Profile updated!");
        // Update session
        SessionManager.getInstance().setCurrentUser(facade.getCurrentUser());
    } else {
        showError("Update failed");
    }
}
```

