## 5.5 Order Status Management

The system supports **5 order statuses** with specific workflows:

| Status | Description | Available Actions | Next Status |
|--------|-------------|-------------------|-------------|
| **Pending** | Order placed, awaiting confirmation | Admin: Confirm or Cancel<br>Customer: Cancel | Confirmed or Canceled |
| **Confirmed** | Order confirmed, inventory reduced | Admin: Update to Shipped | Shipped |
| **Shipped** | Order dispatched to customer | Admin: Update to Delivered | Delivered |
| **Delivered** | Order completed | Customer: Leave Review | - (Terminal) |
| **Canceled** | Order canceled | - | - (Terminal) |

**Status Transition Diagram**:
```
    Pending
       ├─→ Confirmed → Shipped → Delivered
       └─→ Canceled
```

